Now, we note that a lattice point is a point $(a,b)$ where $a$ and $b$ both are integers.  Count the lattice points in the right-most triangle:
[asy]
size(5cm);
draw((-20,20)--(20,20));
draw((-20,-20)--(20,-20));
draw((-20,0)--(20,0));

